# Lab test plan

Generated by `tools/render.py`. Run each test in Packet Tracer, record the actual
result and save a screenshot to `lab/evidence/` named by test ID (for example `T07.png`).
"Not run" is a valid status; never mark a test as passed without running it.

Test hosts: a DHCP PC on EB2-F1-AS Fa0/2 (EB2 staff) and Fa0/6 (EB2 student test port),
Fa0/7 (EB2 guest test port), and EB1-F3-AS Fa0/2 (EB1 staff); static hosts as in `cabling.md`.

